        "TileImage": "$($repository 56e854bc-f006-4cc6-99d9-85fc6898901d).Image",
        "Description": "It was a contract to kill Charles Blake III. That is what the mission briefing told me.\r\r Then Diana had tracked me down on a plane there and gave me the  R E A L  mission briefing. ICA has been comprimised, four government agents awaited me at Whittleton Creek, it was an ambush. Although she had warned me against it, I decided to kill them all myself, luckily I arrived a bit before schedule so they won&apos;t see me coming, only a couple minutes.\r\rCodename: Compromised for the continuation...",
